    {
      "id": "yv-4-25-36",
      "locus": "Yoga-Vāsiṣṭha, Sthiti-prakaraṇa 4.25.36",
      "source_label": "Yoga-Vāsiṣṭha 4.25.36",
      "devanagari": "दामो व्यालः कटश्चेति नामभिः परिलाञ्छिताः । यथाप्राप्तैककर्तारश्चेतनामात्रधर्मिणः",
      "iast": "dāmo vyālaḥ kaṭaśceti nāmabhiḥ parilāñchitāḥ | yathāprāptaikakartāraścetanāmātradharmiṇaḥ",
      "english": "{6:Marked} {5:by the names} {0:Dāma}, {1:Vyāla}, {3:and} {2:Kaṭa} {4:thus}, {7:doers solely of whatever had presented itself}, {8:having cetanā alone as their defining property}.",
