      "devanagari": "अभावात्कर्मणां ते च प्राक्तना नच वासनाः । निर्विकल्पकचिन्मात्रपरिस्पन्दैकधर्मकाः",
      "iast": "abhāvātkarmaṇāṃ te ca prāktanā naca vāsanāḥ | nirvikalpakacinmātraparispandaikadharmakāḥ",
      "english": "{0:Because of the absence} {1:of prior actions}, {2:they} {3:also} {5,6:had no} {4:former} {7:vāsanās}; {8:their sole defining property was the parispanda of non-vikalpaka cit-mātra}.",
